Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.74,0:02:22.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Morning!}¡Buenos días!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{G-Good morning.}B-Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You okay?}¿Estás bien?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.00,0:02:27.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.83,0:02:30.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Does your foot still hurt?}¿Todavía te duele el pie?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.38,0:02:34.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, yeah. The pain's pretty much gone.}Ah, eso.{sí, cierto,} Ya casi no me duele.{no me duele}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.84,0:02:36.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's great!}¡Qué bien!{Me alegro}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.76,0:02:46.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, sorry I didn't respond to your text yesterday.}Oye, disculpa por no responder a tu mensaje ayer.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.18,0:02:49.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I passed out like a sack of potatoes when I got home.}{Caí como un saco de patatas cuando llegué a casa.}{esto será modificado.}{ah}Llegué rendida a mi casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.77,0:02:51.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, that's it?}{mm}¿Entonces fue por eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.77,0:02:58.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I was terrified that you were mad at me or something.}Pensé que estabas enojada conmigo o algo así.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.44,0:03:00.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh man, I'm so sorry!}¡¿Eh?! ¡Perdón, Yuuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.82,0:03:03.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You didn't do anything wrong, Yuuri!}¡Si no hiciste nada malo!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.24,0:03:06.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I thought, maybe...}Pensé que tal vez...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.87,0:03:12.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...you also liked Mabuchi-kun...}... también te gusta Mabuchi-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.08,0:03:14.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No way! Not a chance in hell!}¡Cómo crees! ¡Claro que no!
