Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.71,0:03:19.17,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I did it again...}Lo hice otra vez...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.17,0:03:20.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Really?}¿De veras?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.01,0:03:22.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah...}Sí...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.43,0:03:29.10,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But there's no way I can take that back after seeing her this relieved...}Pero no hay manera de retractarme luego de ver ese rostro aliviado...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.39,0:03:34.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{No problem. I just have to make sure I don't fall for Kou.}No hay problema. {"Está bien"?}Solo tengo que\N asegurarme de no enamorarme de Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.40,0:03:38.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{All those feelings I confused for love}Estos sentimientos que confundo con el amor...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.23,0:03:40.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{were just a lapse in judgement.}solo son un error de juicio.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.11,0:03:45.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{When a mean person acts nice for once, they suddenly look like angels.}Cuando alguien descortés de pronto actúa amablemente, luce como un ángel.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.99,0:03:47.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That must be it.}Eso debe ser.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.83,0:03:53.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{There are plenty of people out there just like him.}Hay un montón de personas como él en el mundo.{ahí afuera}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It's not like... Kou's special or anything.}No es como si Kou... fuera especial o algo así.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.21,0:04:02.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Not one bit!}¡Ni un poco!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.09,0:04:06.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Can I help you, or are you just angry for no reason?}¿Qué te pasa? ¿O es que estás brava conmigo?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.14,0:04:07.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{N-N-No, it's nothing.}N-No, no es nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Good morning, Mabuchi-kun.}Buenos días, Mabuchi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.64,0:04:11.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, hey.}Ah, buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.44,0:04:13.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{See you in class.}Nos vemos en clases.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.73,0:04:21.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri, you're making your crush way too obvious.}Yuuri, si lo miras así parecerás muy obvia.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.86,0:04:23.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sí, pero...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.24,0:04:28.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It'd be nice if he noticed I was acting different.}sería lindo si él notara que estoy actuando diferente.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.75,0:04:36.96,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)}No hay duda de que está\N completamente enamorada de Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri is radiant when she's in love.}Yuuri es radiante cuando está enamorada.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.89,0:04:50.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Makita-san, you like Mabuchi}{-kun} {now?}¿Ahora te gusta Mabuchi{-kun}, Makita-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.89,0:04:54.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's a secret!}¡Es un secreto!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.81,0:04:59.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Anyway, why are you two eating here?}Como sea, ¿por qué están comiendo aquí?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.52,0:05:01.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't be like that. Let's have lunch together.}No seas así. Almorcemos juntas.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.86,0:05:03.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah!}¡Sí!{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.78,0:05:11.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Futaba-chan. You went to the same middle school as Mabuchi-kun, right?}Oye, Futaba-chan, ibas a la misma \Nescuela que Mabuchi-kun, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.49,0:05:15.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? We did, but only for the first semester in our first year.}¿Eh? Ah, sí, pero fue solo el primer semestre de nuestro primer año.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.96,0:05:20.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What was Mabuchi-kun like back then?}¿Cómo era Mabuchi-kun en aquel entonces?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.46,0:05:24.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hmm, back in middle school...}¿Cómo era Kou en la secundaria...?{~}
