Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.80,0:05:28.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou used to be more like a fresh breeze.}Era como una brisa fresca.{wut}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.85,0:05:29.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Really?}¿De veras?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Really...}Oh...{-}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.14,0:05:34.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He was way shorter than he is now, and his voice was higher too.}Era mucho más bajo que ahora, y su voz era más aguda.{esto no sé.}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He was quiet and easy to get along with.}Era tranquilo y fácil de tratar.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not a thing like he is now.}Nada que ver a como es ahora.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Right now, Kou's more like...}Ahora, Kou es más como...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.40,0:05:48.57,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,{"I don't even try. Aren't I cool?"}"Ni siquiera lo intento. ¿No soy genial?".
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.57,0:05:51.62,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,{It's ridiculous!}¡Es ridículo!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.62,0:05:52.66,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,¡Futaba-chan!{diálogos arriba pa' no tapar el cartel}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.04,0:06:00.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then maybe I should try some things out on you.}Entonces debería intentar algunas cosas contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.34,0:06:04.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I was just kidding! That seriously hurts!}¡Solo bromeaba! ¡Eso duele!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.01,0:06:05.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Where's your apology?}¿Dónde está tu disculpa?{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{F-Forgive me...}P-Perdóname...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You two are so funny!}¡Qué divertidos son!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.47,0:06:16.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How was that funny? I'm dying over here!}¿Cómo puede parecer divertido? \N¡Siento que me muero!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.23,0:06:18.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Have some sympathy!}¡Ten un poco de compasión!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.02,0:06:21.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Nah, I wouldn't do this to a girl.}No le haría algo así a una chica.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Excuse me?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.27,0:06:24.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Only if they're girls, you know?}Ya sabes, solo si son chicas.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.98,0:06:27.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I won't lay a hand on Makita.}No se lo haría a Makita.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A girl...}Una chica...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.03,0:06:33.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.41,0:06:36.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You went too far.}Oye, te pasaste.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.58,0:06:40.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'd never do something like that to a girl.}Yo nunca le haría algo así a una chica.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.50,0:06:43.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I wouldn't.}Nunca lo... haría.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.67,0:06:46.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Who are you to talk?}¿Quién te crees para decir eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.84,0:06:50.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're the guy who brought porn to the camp.}Eres el que llevó revistas porno al campamento.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.05,0:06:52.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey! What are you saying in front of Murao?!}¡Oye! ¡¿Qué cosas dices frente a Murao?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.06,0:06:57.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't drag me into this.}Yo no tengo nada que ver con eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You hear that?}¿Escuchaste?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I even shared the porn with you!}¡Encima que compartí el porno contigo!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Damn you!}¡Maldito!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, couldn't hold it in for two days?}¿Qué? ¿No lo podías aguantar?{ya vi cosas que en el mangu siquiera están...}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.15,0:07:10.70,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Are you middle schoolers?}¿Eres de primaria?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Good job!}¡Bien hecho!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm so unathletic.}Soy muy poco atlética.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No worries.}No te preocupes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.26,0:07:35.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Over there!}¡Por aquí!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.77,0:07:47.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun is so cool.}Mabuchi-kun es tan genial.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm so jealous of you, Futaba-chan.}Qué suerte tienes, Futaba-chan.{me gusto así}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.53,0:07:55.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're close to Mabuchi-kun, so you know all about him.}Eres más cercana a Mabuchi-kun, \Ny sabes tantas cosas sobre él.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.24,0:07:56.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I-I wouldn't say that.}Yo no diría eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.99,0:07:59.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, what's his favorite food?}Oye, ¿sabes cuál es su comida favorita?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? Yeah, I wonder...}¿Eh? Quién sabe...{.-.}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.16,0:08:05.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then what about music? What's he into?}¿Y qué tal la música? ¿Qué le gusta?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.13,0:08:08.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Dunno, I've never asked him.}No sé, nunca le pregunté.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.67,0:08:11.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What do you think he does on weekends?}¿Qué crees que haga los fines de semana?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Um, I don't know that either...}Eh, ni idea qué haga...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.84,0:08:16.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then how about his favorite color?}Entonces ¿qué hay de su color favorito?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.36,0:08:33.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You know, I've actually been interested in him for a while now.}¿Sabes? He sentido cierto interés por él desde hace un tiempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.28,0:08:34.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You have?}¿Ah, sí?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.74,0:08:40.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But I didn't realize that I liked him}Pero no me di cuenta que me gustaba,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.91,0:08:44.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{until he helped me cross that river.}hasta que me ayudó a cruzar el río.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.46,0:08:47.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He's really nice,}Es muy agradable,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.63,0:08:50.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{and he makes my heart race,}y hace que mi corazón se acelere,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.71,0:08:53.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but more than that, he's reliable.}pero más que eso, es confiable.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.17,0:08:54.13,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1\move(640,630,640,685,1300,1600)}Super punch!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.84,0:08:59.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri really is cute.}Yuuri es muy linda.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.56,0:09:10.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{All right, homeroom's over.}Muy bien, ya se pueden ir a casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go home.}Vámonos juntas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.23,0:09:13.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure.}Claro.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Murao-san, wanna come with?}Murao-san, ¿vienes con nosotras?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.61,0:09:17.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, right.}Ah, cierto.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.41,0:09:20.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, class reps.}Oigan, representantes de la clase.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.95,0:09:25.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You need to write up a report on the leadership course.}Deben escribir un informe acerca del campamento de liderazgo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Take this.}Tomen esto.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why just the class reps?}¿Por qué solo los representantes?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why not just the class reps?}Por eso mismo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How lucky...}Qué suerte...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.38,0:09:38.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, I'll take care of it, so you can go...}Entonces yo lo haré. Kou, puedes irte...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What are you talking about?}¿Qué dices?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.81,0:09:46.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't just leave you to write it alone with a clear conscience.}No tendría la conciencia tranquila si dejo que lo hagas sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There you go again.}De vuelta con eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.31,0:09:53.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Your words are honorable, but I know you just want to be alone with a girl.}Qué palabras tan dulces, pero lo dices\N simplemente para estar a solas con una chica.{¿no?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Girl?}¿Chica?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Where?}¿Dónde?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.99,0:10:00.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Have fun, closet perv. See ya.}Diviértete, pervertido de clóset. Nos vemos.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.74,0:10:02.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't hit me, stupid.}No me pegues, idiota.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.62,0:10:04.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Tell me about it tomorrow.}Me contarás todo mañana.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.13,0:10:13.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, Futaba-chan.}Lo siento, Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.21,0:10:17.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'd stay and help if I didn't already have plans.}Me quedaría para ayudarte, pero ya tengo planes.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't worry about it. Bye-bye, Yuuri.}No te preocupes.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.26,0:10:19.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't worry about it. Bye-bye, Yuuri.}{\i1}Bye-bye{\i0}, Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.55,0:10:21.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, bye-bye.}Sí, {\i1}bye-bye{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.39,0:10:23.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun, see you tomorrow.}Mabuchi-kun, nos vemos mañana.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure, see you.}Claro, hasta mañana.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.81,0:10:32.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Alright, let's get this over with.}Muy bien, vamos a terminar con esto.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.94,0:10:33.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah.}Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.77,0:10:36.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll do this page. The girl can do the other one.}Haré esta página. Puedes hacer la otra.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.82,0:10:38.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay...}Bueno...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.42,0:10:54.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm getting butterflies in my stomach...}Siento mariposas en el estomago...{DIOSSSSSSSSSSSS Mezashiteeeeeeeeee}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This feeling is new.}Este sentimiento es nuevo...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.26,0:11:07.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou's unexpectedly neat handwriting...}Su escritura es inesperadamente ordenada...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.81,0:11:09.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{His thin fingers...}Sus delgados dedos... {lit bony hands}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.77,0:11:11.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{His shoulders...}Sus hombros...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.98,0:11:18.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{His eyes visible through the gaps in his bangs...}Sus ojos a través del flequillo...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.32,0:11:23.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Everything...}Cualquier...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.45,0:11:26.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Every little thing makes me anxious...}Cualquier detalle me pone nerviosa...{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This might be bad.}Esto podría ser malo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.17,0:11:36.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri likes him now!\fad(0,700)}¡A Yuuri le gusta él!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Get writing.}Ponte a escribir.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.02,0:12:32.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I haven't seen your hand move in a while.}No he visto que hayas movido \Nun dedo durante un buen rato.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.27,0:12:33.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{S-Sorry—}P-Perd—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.27,0:12:34.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Give it here.}A ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Completely blank!}¡Completamente en blanco!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll do it, I promise.}Lo haré, lo prometo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.65,0:12:40.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't believe you volunteered to do the whole thing by yourself.}No puedo creer que te hayas ofrecido para esto.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.61,0:12:43.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're unbelievable.}Lo veo y no lo creo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.03,0:12:46.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Still working on it?}¿Siguen trabajando en eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.07,0:12:48.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, it'll take a bit longer.}Sí, nos tomará un poco más.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Bring it to the faculty office when you're done.}Llévenlo a la sala de profesores cuando terminen.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, got it.}Sí, entendido.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.25,0:12:53.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Está bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.71,0:12:59.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't consider you a pervert, Kou.}No creo que seas un pervertido, Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.21,0:13:02.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.38,0:13:07.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is there something on my back?}¿Hay algo en mi espalda?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.01,0:13:11.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Uh, yeah. There is.}Ah, sí. Hay algo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You've got to be kidding me.}Bromeas, ¿no?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.10,0:13:15.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That little...}Ese maldito...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.31,0:13:16.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\blur0.22\3c&H84A74F&\i0\fnVogel\pos(1080,114)}{Pervy!}¡Chico Pervertido!{((((((??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Grab it for me.}Quítalo por mí.{no sé cómo ponerle}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.52,0:13:19.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure...}Ah, claro...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This isn't fair.}Esto no es justo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.41,0:13:38.71,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I just can't resist the back of his neck.}Simplemente no puedo resistirme a su nuca.{parte de atrás?}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.88,0:13:42.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't sniff me.}No me huelas.{olfatees}{aish}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.92,0:13:46.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know you've been taking whiffs of me.}Sé que lo has estado haciendo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's wrong with you?}¿Qué con eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.43,0:13:50.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?! I haven't taken whiffs of anyone! Prove it!}¡¿Qué?! ¡¿Cómo que te he\N estado oliendo?! ¡Demuéstralo!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.68,0:13:51.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know you do!}¡Sé que lo haces!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.64,0:13:54.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Like back when I carried you during orienteering.}Lo hiciste cuando te cargué en la orientación.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And the time you were rubbing my head in the lobby at the inn.}Y cuando me acariciabas la cabeza{} en el vestíbulo en la posada.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.23,0:14:01.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I-I wouldn't say I sniffed you!}¡N-No diría que te estaba oliendo!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.32,0:14:02.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I just happened to smell you...}Simplemente pasó...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.86,0:14:03.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And also...}Y también...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.19,0:14:06.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No also! Those were the only times!}¡No más! ¡Esas fueron las únicas veces!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.65,0:14:09.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{When we played cops and robbers.}Cuando jugábamos "Policías y Ladrones".
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.92,0:14:22.09,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He knew.}Lo sabía...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.38,0:14:28.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Even his payback is lame.}Incluso tu memoria es mala.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.22,0:14:29.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's the deal with this?}¿Y qué con esto?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.59,0:14:32.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on, give me your sheet.}Vamos, dame tu hoja.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It'll be faster if I do it.}Será más rápido si lo hago yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm sorry.}Perdón.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.27,0:14:39.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He knew... he knew!}Él lo sabía... ¡Él lo sabía...!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.52,0:14:41.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're telling me.}Por Dios.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.36,0:14:46.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If I wasn't around, you'd be here all night.}Si no estuviera aquí, \Nseguro te llevaría toda la noche terminarlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.65,0:14:49.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What do I do...}¿Qué hago?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.28,0:14:54.41,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This is bad. Every time I think of Kou,\fad(0,550)}Esto es malo. Cada vez que pienso en Kou,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.37,0:14:58.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri's face comes to mind.\fad(550,750)}el rostro de Yuuri me viene a la mente.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.92,0:15:04.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I was just admiring the sky.}Solo admiraba el cielo.{Solamente pensaba que el cielo se ve bonito}{algo así escucho}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.30,0:15:18.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Aw, man. I wish I was a class rep.}Ah...{;_;} Me gustaría ser representante de la clase.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.27,0:15:20.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan said she didn't like Mabuchi-kun,}Futaba-chan dijo que no le gustaba Mabuchi-kun,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.85,0:15:23.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan said she didn't like Mabuchi-kun,}Futaba-chan dijo que no le gustaba Mabuchi-kun,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.44,0:15:28.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but there's no telling what he thinks of her.}pero no sé qué piensa él {sobre}de ella.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.28,0:15:30.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, what do you think?}Oye, ¿tú qué crees?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How am I supposed to know?}¿Cómo voy a saberlo?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.62,0:15:37.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't get it off my mind!}¡No puedo sacarlo de mi mente!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.96,0:15:43.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Enamorarse de alguien es muy estimulante,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.54,0:15:45.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,pero a veces también puede deprimirte.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.60,0:16:01.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We managed to finish up pretty early.}Nos las arreglamos para terminar rápido.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.90,0:16:11.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If I spend any more time with Kou alone...}Si paso más tiempo a solas con Kou...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.49,0:16:14.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.45,0:16:19.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mira, si quieres puedo entregar yo el informe.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.66,0:16:22.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, you'll do it?}Ah, ¿lo harías?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.04,0:16:24.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks, then.}Bueno, te lo encargo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Bye.}Adiós.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This is definitely bad.}Esto definitivamente es malo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I won't be able to turn back.}Ya no puedo volver atrás.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.51,0:16:40.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Got it, thanks.}Bien, gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Excuse me, then.}Con permiso.{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.03,0:17:00.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why...}¿Por qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.21,0:17:13.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, why are you here?}Kou, ¿por qué sigues aquí?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.13,0:17:16.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What do you mean?}¿A qué te refieres?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.14,0:17:18.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm waiting for you.}Te estaba esperando.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.56,0:17:24.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Didn't you say to wait up while you were handing the report in?}¿No dijiste que esperara mientras entregabas el informe?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.90,0:17:31.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I meant for you to go on home without me.}Quise decir que podías volver a casa sin mí.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.99,0:17:34.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, did you?}Ah, ¿era eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.99,0:17:39.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But we take the same train, so wouldn't that be kind of strange?}Pero tomamos el mismo tren,\N ¿no sería un poco extraño?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.16,0:17:40.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I-I guess so.}Creo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.87,0:17:42.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, whatever.}Bueno, como sea.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.12,0:17:48.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go.}Volvamos a casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.84,0:17:52.09,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{At this rate...}A este ritmo...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.71,0:17:54.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'll really fall in love.}... terminaré enamorada.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.18,0:18:08.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, first that apology essay and now this report—all this writing is killing me.}Increíble, primero un ensayo de disculpas y ahora este informe. Escribir tanto me está matando.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.53,0:18:17.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And the event planners get out of everything scot-free.}Y los organizadores de eventos no hacen nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But...}Pero...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.79,0:18:26.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.17,0:18:38.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What should I do when I've fallen for the same boy my friend has?}¿Qué debería hacer si me llego a enamorar de la misma persona que mi amiga?{yo pondría los bordes celestes <3}{k}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.88,0:18:44.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If this is how it's going to feel, I'd rather forget all about Kou.}Si así me voy a sentir, prefiero olvidar todo sobre Kou.{prefiero no gustar de Kou}{K}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.52,0:18:48.60,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But... I want to love.}Pero... quiero enamorarme.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.52,0:18:52.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But... but...}Pero... Pero...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.27,0:18:54.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But!}¡Pero...!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Our train's right here.}Nuestro tren acaba de llegar.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.33,0:19:12.71,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Please, just let somebody make the decision for me.} {dejaré que alguien tome la desición por mí}{Por favor,debo hacer que alguien tome la decisión por mí.}Dios, que alguien decida por mí.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.09,0:19:21.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I think I forgot something.}Creo que olvidé algo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So...}Por eso...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.68,0:19:28.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If Kou doesn't get off the train, then I'll forget all about him.}Si Kou no baja del tren, olvidaré todo sobre él.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.89,0:19:31.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, you forgot something?}¿Se te olvidó algo? ¿En serio?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.31,0:19:36.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If he gets off, then I'll love him.}Si se baja, entonces lo amaré. {*3*}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.44,0:19:37.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I see.}Ya veo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.40,0:19:44.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If he stays, I'll forget. If he gets off, I'll love.}Si se va, lo olvido. Si se baja, no lo haré.{}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.41,0:19:51.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If he stays, I'll forget. If he gets off, I'll love.}Si se va, lo olvido. Si se baja, no lo haré.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If he stays, I'll forget.}Si se va, lo olvido.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.75,0:19:56.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If he gets off, I'll love.}Si se baja, no lo haré.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.42,0:19:58.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{The doors will be closing momentarily.}Las puertas se cerrarán.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.51,0:20:03.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If he stays...}Si se va...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Get off!}¡Bájate!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.26,0:20:52.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So, did you leave it at school?}¿Qué? ¿Lo que olvidaste está en la escuela?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.48,0:20:53.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's head back.}Regresemos.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.98,0:20:59.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm such a liar.}Soy una mentirosa.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.23,0:21:02.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I never actually had a choice.}No tenía otra elección.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.82,0:21:04.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.41,0:21:08.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I didn't actually forget anything.}Perdón, en verdad no olvidé nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.33,0:21:09.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?!}¡¿Qué?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.79,0:21:12.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't go crazy on me.}Me volverás loco.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.79,0:21:17.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I pretended to hesitate, but I always knew the answer.}Fingí no saberlo, pero siempre supe la respuesta.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.21,0:21:19.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.38,0:21:22.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's wrong?}¿Qué pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Do you feel okay?}¿Te sientes bien?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.63,0:21:28.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{And not only that...}Y no solo eso...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.26,0:21:31.60,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I already knew that Kou would get off.}Sabía que Kou bajaría.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.35,0:21:36.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri, I'm sorry.\fad(600,700)}Yuuri, lo siento.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.78,0:21:43.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I also...}Yo también...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I also...}Yo también...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...love Kou.}... estoy enamorada de Kou.{A mí también... me gusta Kou.}
